title: "Mock: GitHub consent for Cloudflare Access"
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Mock: GitHub consent for Cloudflare Access
  accDescr: GitHub asks the operator and each reader to grant Cloudflare Access read-only organizations and teams plus read-only email addresses.
  app["Authorize Team docs (Access)<br/>Cloudflare Access wants GitHub account access"] --> orgs["Organizations and teams<br/>read-only<br/>list memberships"]
  app --> email["Email addresses<br/>read-only<br/>identity for Access JWT"]
  orgs --> authorize["Authorize"]
  email --> authorize
  authorize --> question["Access can later ask GitHub<br/>which orgs is this person in?"]
  class app primary
  class orgs,email secondary
  class authorize,question success
  classDef primary fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2c2c2c,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef secondary fill:#e8f0ea,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef success fill:#1f3a2e,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#f7f3e8,stroke-width:2px
